cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use these workflows, please cite them, Pennsieve (preferred-citation) when you used Pennsieve to store, analyse, share or publish the data, the datasets you used and the methods each app lists.
type: software
title: Single-cell workflows on Pennsieve
abstract: Workflows for single-nucleus and single-cell RNA-seq (atlas mapping and condition comparison) and single-nucleus multiome (gene regulation), built from the sc-* and atac-* apps.
